{"id":"wb-6-955","name":"陈英士墓","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"陈英士墓","text":"陈英士墓是中国同盟会主要骨干陈英士（其美）的墓葬建筑群。位于陈英士家乡，今浙江省湖州市的南郊岘山东麓。始建于民国七年（1918年）始建，民国二十三年（1934年）扩建，分墓道、石碑坊、墓穴三部分。文化大革命期间遭到严重破坏，1984年得到重建。现为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%99%88%E8%8B%B1%E5%A3%AB%E5%A2%93","revisionId":86856433,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86856433","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/b99818dda2c71051d8c83661.jpg","title":"Huzhou_Chen_Yingshi_Mu_2017.05.07_12-21-47.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Huzhou_Chen_Yingshi_Mu_2017.05.07_12-21-47.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/18/Huzhou_Chen_Yingshi_Mu_2017.05.07_12-21-47.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"陈英士墓","width":320,"height":213}}